    "campaign": "International Coffee Day",
    "caption": "Enjoy your Folgers Instant Coffee Classic Roast as cookies in this easy peasy recipe that yields two dozen in less than an hour. One of the best things about these cookies is that all the ingredients can be found in either your pantry or fridge!\n\nGreat to prepare for personal snacking or for gifting to loved ones, these Crispy Coffee Cookies are best enjoyed with — what else — a piping-hot mug of coffee! Head over to #TheMarketplace and stock up on Folgers Coffee products today!\n\nServing Time: 45 minutes \nYield: 24 cookies\n\nIngredients\n\n2 ½ cups all-purpose flour\n1 ½ tsps. baking powder\n¾ tsp. salt\n1 cup sugar\n¾ cup canola oil\n⅓ cup Folgers Instant Coffee Classic Roast\n2 tbsps. hot water\n2 large eggs\nExtra sugar for rolling\n\nProcedure\n\n1. Preheat oven to 200°C. Line 2 baking trays with parchment.\n2. In a bowl, mix flour, baking powder, and salt. Set aside. In a larger bowl, mix sugar and oil.\n3. Dissolve Folgers Instant Coffee Classic Roast in hot water then add to the sugar mixture. Mix well and add eggs one at a time, until ribbony. Fold in dry ingredients until combined. \n4. Scoop cookie dough into 1-inch balls and roll in sugar. Arrange on the trays and lightly flatten with a spoon. Bake for 8-10 mins. or until edges are crisp. Cool before serving.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
