    "caption": "This coffee creation will make you go bananas!\n\nConcocted with Vitasoy Barista Soy Milk, this Banoffee Coffee blends the flavors of the popular banoffee pie — think caramel, brown sugar, and yes, bananas — all combined into a delicious soy latte. Definitely a homemade indulgence that you can enjoy whenever you please.\n\nVitasoy Barista Soy Milk is available at #TheMarketplace! Head on over today and stock up on their barista variant which is perfect for frothing and steaming.\n\nServing Time: 15 minutes\nYield: 2 glasses\nTip (Optional): Double the espresso for stronger coffee.\n\nIngredients\n\nFor the cafe latte:\n2 shots espresso\n1 cup Vitasoy Soy Milk Cafe Barista, steamed\n1 tbsp. caramel syrup, plus more\n\nFor the sweet cream foam:\n2 tbsps. heavy cream, cold\n½ cup Vitasoy Soy Milk Cafe Barista, cold\n1 tbsp. sugar\n\nFor assembly:\n1 banana, sliced\n2 tbsps. brown sugar, plus more for rimming\n\nProcedure\n1. In a pan over medium heat, melt brown sugar and toss banana slices until coated. Set aside.\n2. In a pitcher, stir espresso, steamed Vitasoy Soy Milk Cafe Barista, and caramel syrup until combined. Divide into brown sugar-rimmed mugs.\n3. In a separate glass, add heavy cream, sugar, and soy milk. Mix with a frother until thick, then layer over the coffee. \n4. Garnish with caramelized banana. Drizzle extra caramel as desired.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
